109
00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:10.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是过去还是现在</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:10.698 --> 00:08:13.868 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
