<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:26.245 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>四次 看来真的很讨厌我</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:26.328 --> 00:12:27.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:31.417 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
