<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:34.837 --> 00:12:35.796 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你会怎么办呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

