211
00:14:40.212 --> 00:14:42.590 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>奸贼大久保 受死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.051 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保！</c.simplifiedchinese>

