<c.simplifiedchinese>没办法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:01.025 --> 00:15:05.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-大久保就是我们杀的
-岛田</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:07.281 --> 00:15:11.201 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有别的目击者
大久保就是我们七个杀的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:13.537 --> 00:15:15.164 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:16.373 --> 00:15:19.668 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治11年5月14日</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:19.752 --> 00:15:21.754 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>纪尾井坂之变</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:21.837 --> 00:15:24.131 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>站在明治权力顶点的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:24.214 --> 00:15:27.635 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在光天化日下被刺杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:27.718 --> 00:15:32.389 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这样行凶者
被认为是心怀不满的石川县武士团体</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:32.473 --> 00:15:36.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄一派的存在未被世人知晓</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:38.145 --> 00:15:39.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保先生…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:44.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也一样 想要保住性命
就不要跟志志雄大人作对</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:51.116 --> 00:15:53.202 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄真实…</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:54.995 --> 00:15:56.914 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是志志雄的风格！</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:57.581 --> 00:15:59.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们从不会亲自露面</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:59.708 --> 00:16:04.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到造反的那天为止
慢慢地削弱明治政府的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:06.006 --> 00:16:07.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿…</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:09.885 --> 00:16:11.136 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打扰了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:14.098 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是福岛县令山吉先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:14.598 --> 00:16:17.726 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一个跟大久保卿谈话的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.562 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在东京会议之后</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:24.400 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>今早我来大久保宅拜访</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:26.485 --> 00:16:29.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新已经过去了十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要说有什么成就
很惭愧 但我们实绩实在太少</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:34.243 --> 00:16:35.869 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 重点在于今后</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:37.162 --> 00:16:41.709 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>巩固一个新兴国家的基础
必须要三十年的时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:42.292 --> 00:16:46.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前的十年是第一期创业阶段</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:46.672 --> 00:16:49.466 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来的十年就是发展阶段</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:53.178 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要整顿内政 让国家基础完备</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:53.262 --> 00:16:55.514 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是最重要的时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:56.181 --> 00:16:59.852 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不才 但第二个十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:59.935 --> 00:17:02.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想排除万难达成目标</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:03.063 --> 00:17:07.609 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后的第三个守成阶段
就要交给后继者了</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:07.693 --> 00:17:11.196 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>召开议会 将政体向国民政治过度</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:11.989 --> 00:17:15.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后日本会变成一个国民国家</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:15.993 --> 00:17:19.038 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治维新就真的完成了</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:24.251 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>国民国家吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:24.334 --> 00:17:28.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不再由统治者替他们做决定</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:28.172 --> 00:17:31.300 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是一个由国民自己来选择前进道路</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:32.426 --> 00:17:34.595 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是很远大的理想啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:34.678 --> 00:17:37.681 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但却是足以相信的理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:39.016 --> 00:17:41.685 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果大久保卿还在的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:42.728 --> 00:17:44.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>号外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:44.938 --> 00:17:47.816 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保被暗杀！内务卿被暗杀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.902 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>号外！</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:49.985 --> 00:17:55.282 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们就这样失去了最后一位维新三杰
也失去了最伟大的指导者</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:55.365 --> 00:17:59.870 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>政治界只剩平庸之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:01.205 --> 00:18:05.459 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天开始 日本陷入了迷途</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:06.043 --> 00:18:09.630 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而志志雄绝不会放过这个机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:11.673 --> 00:18:15.636 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代的车轮再度开始转动</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:19.681 --> 00:18:23.102 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>偏偏这么晚了还有急诊病人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:23.185 --> 00:18:25.312 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我送她们到马车那边</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:25.395 --> 00:18:27.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 小心点</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:32.611 --> 00:18:35.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…还不回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:37.407 --> 00:18:38.909 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:45.499 --> 00:18:47.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦呢？
-啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:47.835 --> 00:18:48.710 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（神谷活心流 剑术道场）</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:50.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他等得太累睡着了</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:51.213 --> 00:18:52.089 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:53.507 --> 00:18:54.967 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:55.551 --> 00:18:58.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保卿今天早上被暗杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:58.428 --> 00:19:01.014 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道…我听到了号外</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:19:01.765 --> 00:19:04.184 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真正的凶手是志志雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:19:06.019 --> 00:19:08.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再这样放任他们不管</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:12.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下要去京都</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:17.197 --> 00:19:20.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去暗杀志志雄真实吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:20.576 --> 00:19:22.161 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:22.244 --> 00:19:23.912 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过还不确定</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:25.706 --> 00:19:30.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来到道场后 一直过着放松的日子</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:30.085 --> 00:19:36.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下甚至以为真的可以
从刽子手变成一介普通剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:38.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:38.468 --> 00:19:44.266 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟斋藤的战斗让在下明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:44.349 --> 00:19:49.479 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下的心里其实没有任何变化
还住着一个疯狂的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:49.563 --> 00:19:51.940 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是你很快就会变回来的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:52.024 --> 00:19:55.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你变得再怎么接近拔刀斋
剑心还是剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:55.652 --> 00:19:59.781 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫和斋藤两次都是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:01.200 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:02.993 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>并不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:05.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫那次</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:05.704 --> 00:20:08.999 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一心想着救你 在下才变成了刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.336 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到薰小姐的声音又恢复了理智</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:12.419 --> 00:20:14.713 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是和斋藤交手时</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:14.796 --> 00:20:17.299 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下变回拔刀斋只是为了战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.720 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以根本听不到薰小姐的声音</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:22.763 --> 00:20:24.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是完全不同的</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.269 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时代的车轮再度开始转动</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:30.896 --> 00:20:32.814 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>初见时</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:32.898 --> 00:20:35.943 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使知道在下是刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:36.026 --> 00:20:38.278 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐仍然做出挽留</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:38.946 --> 00:20:42.783 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“我不在乎别人的过去” 你说</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:44.785 --> 00:20:46.286 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下真的很高兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:48.705 --> 00:20:50.749 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果继续留在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:20:50.832 --> 00:20:54.419 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>会屡屡让你们涉险</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:20:54.503 --> 00:20:58.548 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也会一次次变成拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:59.258 --> 00:21:02.803 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>何况对于政府 对于志志雄</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:21:02.886 --> 00:21:07.516 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及国内众多
憎恨刽子手拔刀斋的人来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:21:07.599 --> 00:21:10.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下永远都只是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:21:11.603 --> 00:21:15.023 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不能再留在这里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:21:20.028 --> 00:21:23.532 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你一直以来的照顾 那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:21:24.283 --> 00:21:25.284 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见了</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:21:26.868 --> 00:21:28.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:21:29.037 --> 00:21:32.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要再度…启程了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:21:46.388 --> 00:21:48.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:21:54.354 --> 00:21:57.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:21:58.859 --> 00:22:02.237 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治11年5月14日</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:22:02.321 --> 00:22:06.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心再次成为浪客踏上旅途</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:22:07.034 --> 00:22:11.330 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个人独自消失在了漆黑的暗夜里</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:22:13.123 --> 00:22:15.542 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:22:15.625 --> 00:22:18.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那把日本刀我就拿来抵给你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:22:19.421 --> 00:22:23.550 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么多年杳无音信 你现在露面</c.simplifiedchinese>

